      <h2>Disputes are decided on evidence.<br />Most sellers don't have it.</h2>
      <p class="sub">Claims like these eat into your margin and your time. Without a record of what you packed, arguing is hard — and refunding is easy.</p>
      <div class="pain-grid">
        <div class="pain">
          <div class="c-head"><span class="ic"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16Z"/><path d="m3.3 7 8.7 5 8.7-5"/><path d="M12 22V12"/></svg></span><h3>"The box arrived empty"</h3></div>
          <p>A buyer says the parcel came empty. You know you packed it right — but without video, it's your word against theirs.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pain">
          <div class="c-head"><span class="ic"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 0 1 15-6.7L21 8"/><path d="M21 3v5h-5"/><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 0 1-15 6.7L3 16"/><path d="M3 21v-5h5"/></svg></span><h3>"That's not what I ordered"</h3></div>
          <p>Wrong-item and parcel-swap claims come back to you. Refund issued, item not returned, and the seller rating takes a hit.</p>
        </div>
